Description:
Din oberoende konsultpartner för en smartare mobilitet.

Vi erbjuder:

Strategisk rådgivning;
Vi erbjuder strategisk rådgivning och omvärldsanalys för att optimera er affärsverksamhet och nå era mål effektivt. 

Taktisk planering;
En genomlysning av processer identifierar möjligheter till förbättring,  effektivitet och styrning mot strategier.

Operativa analyser;
Våra analyser ger er de insikter ni behöver för att förstå hur en vagnpark kan hanteras och vilka möjligheter som finns.

Med Xperterna får du hjälp av oberoende experter med 50 års operativa erfarenheter från branschen som sänker era fordonskostnader med upp till 20%.

Kontakta oss om du vill veta mer.

By offering our clients cutting-edge expertise connected to the strategies, funds and programmes of the EU, we increase your opportunities to gain access to a variety of development processes and resources. Our commitment reduces the risks, unlocks the potential and increases the impact of your development work. Our solid EU competence is the fruit of many years of accumulated knowledge and experience on a local, regional, national as well as European level. Our EU services are adjusted to the specific needs and conditions of each single client. It is often a matter of strengthening the client’s capacity by offering a combination of the following services:
- Project development
- Examination and evaluation
- EU strategic counselling
- Training
- Project administration
- Consulting and support for company internationalisation processes;
- Support for international growth strategies;
- Support to start ups and innovative SMEs;
- Support to networking and new intercompany business;
- Technology scouting, foreign growth and market development.

Moreover, the fundamental values permeating the vision of European Minds are inclusion, equality and co-creation. Our belief is that sustainable development for the good of people and regions can be reached only in collaborative, co-productive processes, in which stakeholders and end users participate on equal terms.

What we do //

// Coding
We can add or change any modules, such as built-in stores, payment systems, etc. We can also code any features you have in mind.

// Design
We can change small details such as colors and shape of buttons, fonts, appearance of blocks. We can also make a completely new design for your website.

// Content
We can change the text, add pics or edits that you provide. We even write articles on any topic for your website.
